# Dashboard build-time configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.production`) only if the dashboard is hosted on a
# different origin from the API. Leave it unset for the normal deployment,
# where FastAPI serves this bundle itself and the API is same-origin.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.production
#
# VITE_API_BASE   Absolute origin of the backend, without a trailing slash and
#                 without /api. The client appends /api itself.
#                 Example: VITE_API_BASE=https://odyssey-transform-core.onrender.com
#
# When you set this, add the dashboard's origin to the backend's CORS_ORIGINS
# or the browser will block every response.
#
# ODYSSEY_API     Dev-server proxy target only (vite.config.ts). Ignored by the
#                 production bundle. Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000.

VITE_API_BASE=
ODYSSEY_API=http://127.0.0.1:8000
